* {{Symbol|Target|Portrait}}
** [[Portrait-casting]] applies only the debuff centered around Brewmaster.
** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} component is applied only when the enemy unit(s) are within the same coordinates as Brewmaster.

