{{Stealnotes
| name = Primal Split
| desc = Grants {{A|Brewmaster|Drunken Brawler}} indirectly upon acquiring this ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Primal Split icon0}}
| desc = Splits Brewmaster into elements, forming 3 specialized warriors, adept at survival, each with their own abilities. If any of them survive until the end of their summoned timer, the Brewmaster is reborn. Each Warrior gains its respective Drunken Brawler stance.
}}
<hr>
* {{cf|expr}} [[File:Dota2 Brewmaster Primal Split Formation icon-1.png|105px|Primal Split Formation]]
** Brewmaster is in centerpoint [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] , and point [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|21px|F]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] forms a [[Wikipedia:Equilateral triangle|equilateral triangle]].
*** {{Code|[[Wikipedia:Altitude_(triangle)|h]] {{=}} {{#expr:{{#vardefineecho:b|({{#var:Primal Split value3}}+{{#var:Primal Split value3}}/2)}}}}}}
*** {{Code|PQ {{=}} PR {{=}} {{#expr:{{#vardefineecho:a|({{#var:b}}*sin(90*pi/180)/sin(60*pi/180))}} round3}}}}
*** {{Code|OP {{=}} OR {{=}} PR/2 {{=}} {{#expr:{{#vardefineecho:c|({{#var:b}}*sin(30*pi/180)/sin(60*pi/180))}} round3}}}}
** Point [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] is {{#var:Primal Split value3}}-distance in front of Brewmaster, point [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|21px|F]] and [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] is {{#expr:{{#var:Primal Split value3}}/2}}-distance, and {{#expr:{{#var:c}} round3}}-distance [[File:Dota2 West.png|31px|West]] and [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px|East]] 30° behind Brewmaster respectively.

* Recasting the ability creates new Brewlings of its corresponding level and resets the {{M|cooldown}} of all Brewlings' abilities.

